    smartReschedule:"Smart Reschedule is a Pro feature.",
    brainDump:"Brain Dump is a Pro feature.",
    projectBreakdown:"AI project breakdowns are a Pro feature.",
    aiArrange:"AI scheduling is a Pro feature.",
